| Test 1: which sound and support modules are loaded, and the settings.
Obey <Obey$Dir>.Setup
Echo ==== 1 Info: <Sys$Date> <Sys$Time> ==== { >> <MSTest$Out> }
Echo SoftMIDI$SoundFont = <SoftMIDI$SoundFont> { >> <MSTest$Out> }
Echo SoftMIDI$Output = <SoftMIDI$Output> { >> <MSTest$Out> }
Help SharedSound { >> <MSTest$Out> }
Help StreamManager { >> <MSTest$Out> }
Help SharedSoundBuffer { >> <MSTest$Out> }
Help DigitalRenderer { >> <MSTest$Out> }
Help ARMEABISupport { >> <MSTest$Out> }
Help VFPSupport { >> <MSTest$Out> }
Echo Test 1 done: the module versions are in Results.
